# set-budget-1 — the plain control, no verdict label: an OPEN over-budget goal refuses identically
# whether or not it is post-launch. The base world's `Budget: 5` makes the same descendant tree
# (Σ $3.00) sit WITHIN; this patch drops the line to $1 so the same tree is EXHAUSTED — the refusal
# is about the SUM, not about the goal's phase.
.body = "Budget: 1\nVerdict-authority: human\n"
